    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "BROE auctioneers is pleased to present this magnificent family home to the market. \r\n85 Cherrywood Grove offers the perfect balance of living and bedroom accommodation. A most impressive semi-detached family home, constructed circa 1980 discretely tucked away in arguably one of the best positions within Clondalkin. A particularly popular and much sought-after family orientated area. Situated in a quiet and mature Neighborhood. The accommodation comprises of storm porch, a bright entrance hall, a large living room with a featured fireplace, bright kitchen cum dinging area which opens to a private rear garden. There is also three bright bedrooms and a family bathroom. To the rear of the property, you will find a low maintenance east facing back garden to include a block shed. Ideally located close by to Clondalkin Village. Cherrywood is mature and sought after area. The property itself is within walking distance from the Clondalkin Village and local amenities, including, shops, schools, leisure facilities, hotels, bars and restaurants. Local public transport links are in close proximity and within walking distance to the Luas Redcow and the M50 & N7 motorways are easily accessible to all parts of the county. \r\n\r\nContact Shauna O’Brien to register your interest."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Porch \t\t\t0.54m x 1.34m \t\tTiled flooring. \t\r\n\r\n\r\nEntrance hallway\t\t3.75m x 1.36m \t\tBright entrance hall to include wood flooring, \r\nand ample storage.  \r\n\t\r\nLounge\t\t\t4.55m x 3.34m\t\tLarge lounge area to include feature fireplace, \r\nwood flooring, T.V point and ceiling covings. \r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining room\t5.05m x 2.42m\t\tShaker style floor and eye level units, tiled\r\nflooring. PVC door opening onto a private east facing garden.  \r\n\r\n\r\n(1) Bedroom\t\t\t3.67m x 2.75m\t\tTo include Carpet Flooring. \r\n\r\n\r\n(2) Bedroom\t\t\t3.39m x 3.60m\t\tTo include wood flooring and built in wardrobes. \r\n\r\n\r\n(3) Bedroom\t\t\t2.43m x 2.60m \t\tTo include wood flooring.\r\n\t\r\n\r\nBathroom\t\t\t1.90m x 1.89m\t\tBathroom to include W.H.B, W.C and Mira 84 \r\nshower. \r\n\r\nGarden\t\t\t10.63m x 7.34m\t\tLow maintenance east facing rear garden, \r\nto include block shed to rear that is wired for electricity. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only.\r\n\r\nPlease note any information, statement, description, quantity or measurement so given or contained in any such sales particulars, webpage, brochure, catalogue, email, letter, written valuations or hand out issued by or on behalf of BROE auctioneers are for illustration purposes only and are not to be taken as matters of fact. Any mistake, omission, inaccuracy or mis description given orally or contained in any sales particulars, webpage, brochure, catalogue, email, letter, written valuation or hand out issues by BROE auctioneers. Agents shall not give rise to any right of action, claim, entitlement or compensation against BROE auctioneers. Intending purchasers must satisfy themselves by carrying out their own independent due diligence, inspections or otherwise as to the correctness of any and all the information, statements, descriptions, quantity or measurements contained in any such sales particulars, webpage, brochure, catalogue, email, letter, written valuation or hand out issued by BROE auctioneers. The services, systems and appliances shown have not been tested and no warranty is made or given by BROE auctioneers as to their operability or efficiency."
      },
